# AxizPOS navigation tabs

Navigation tabs always use `AxizTabs` from `@ai-pos/ui`. The active tab is charcoal text with the AxizPOS orange underline. Inactive tabs are neutral text on a transparent background, with a bottom border under the row.

Do not introduce pill-style navigation tabs, rounded tab buttons, or a filled background behind the active tab.

Pills and `SegmentedControl` stay for filters, status selections, date ranges, sort controls, view-mode switches, and other controls whose behavior calls for them.

Keep permission and entitlement checks in the page. Hide a tab with `hidden`, or mark it `disabled`. Do not fetch data inside `AxizTabs`.

```tsx
<AxizTabs
  ariaLabel="Inventory sections"
  tabs={[
    { id: "stock", label: "Stock" },
    { id: "products", label: "Products" },
  ]}
  activeTab={activeTab}
  onChange={setActiveTab}
/>
```
